<title>USA: TENNIS-HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT, Rhode Island 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$255,000 Hall of Fame Championships grass court tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Alex Radulescu (Germany) beat Ben Ellwood (Australia) 7-6</p>
<p>(12-10) 6-3</p>
<p>2-Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Doug Flach (U.S.) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>3-Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat Luke Jensen (U.S.) 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>4-Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Kevin Ullyett (South Africa)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>5-Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) beat David Dilucia (U.S.) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>7-Leander Paes (India) beat Stephane Simian (France) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>8-Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Bryan Shelton (U.S.) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>David Wheaton (U.S.) beat Michael Joyce (U.S.) 7-6 (7-5) 4-6</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
